( https://albiononline.com/news/undead-direwolf )

Adventurer,

The brand-new *Undead Direwolf* ( https://albiononline.com/news/undead-dire=
wolf ) skin is now available in the in-game store! This premiere mount skin=
 transforms your Direwolf base mount into an unholy beast, raised from the =
dead through forbidden magic. With its eerie glowing eyes, tattered pelt, a=
nd exposed ribcage, it's sure to strike fear into your enemies as you stalk=
 them from the shadows.

Characterized by their *high overall speed and maneuverability* , Direwolve=
s are consistently one of Albion's most-used mounts. The Undead Direwolf ad=
ds another option for those looking to upgrade their Direwolf's appearance,=
 and joins a growing collection of skins for this ever-popular mount.

( https://albiononline.com/news/lands-awakened-patch-8 )

Patch 8 is Live
---------------

*Lands Awakened Patch 8 ( https://albiononline.com/news/lands-awakened-patc=
h-8 )* is now live! This patch brings some significant improvements, includ=
ing:

* Improvements to *Arena matchmaking*
* Extensive *combat balance* changes
* The *Season 14 winner statues* in Conquerors=E2=80=99 Hall
* New *=E2=80=9CHood and Scythe=E2=80=9D* guild logo
* =E2=80=A6 and more

For the complete patchnotes, *click here* ( https://albiononline.com/change=
log/lands-awakened-patch-8 ).

( https://albiononline.com/news/invasion-day-apr-2022 )

Watch Invasion Day Live
-----------------------

*Saturday 30th April* marks the final Invasion Day of Season 15. All Season=
 Points earned will be doubled, as will Might and Favor from killing Siphon=
ing Mages - and we=E2=80=99ll be broadcasting the action live on *AlbionTV =
( https://www.twitch.tv/albiononline ) ,* so make sure to tune in! For the =
full broadcast schedule, click here:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/invasion-day-apr-2022 )

